September 2012.

  Grant proposals were accepted through October 23, 2012.  This initial proposal was
similar to a concept paper that let the H&CD Office know what the applicant’s goal
was and a cost for accomplishing that goal.

  A Public Notice was published in October 2012, along with a News Release, making
residents aware of grant proposal submissions, and encouraging residents to attend
a Public Hearing on November 7, 2012, and submit written comments.

