GED/ABE completion

Money Management

Job referral and placement

Enhancing interviewing skills

First time homeownership opportunities

Family/Group activities

2. Troubled . . .

  The Cheyenne Housing Authority is not a troubled public housing agency.  On the
contrary, the CHA functions exceptionally well with the resources it has.
